# ─── Claude orchestration-kit overlay — NOT published in the open-source repo ───
# The kit's project-management scaffolding, config, tracking data, and generated
# views are local-only. Ignoring the whole overlay keeps the public repository to
# the react-server-table library source. These files stay on disk and keep working
# locally; git simply never sees them.

# Kit infrastructure — staged assets used by kit slash commands
.kit/

# Claude Code config, commands, agents, hooks, tracking logs, cloned tools (ccpm), etc.
.claude/

